  "translation": "This morning, I set out from home and went to a vegetable market with my mom. We first stopped in front of a vegetable stall, bought three cucumbers and two pieces of tofu. Mom asked the boss, 'How are these vegetables sold?' The boss said, 'Ten yuan in total.' Mom thought it was too expensive, so she bargained with him. In the end, we used eight yuan to buy them. Then we went to the fish stall. There were many fish. I didn't choose small ones; I chose a big one. Mom was very satisfied and said, 'Tonight we'll make braised fish. I can cook.' After returning home, Mom was busy in the kitchen. I carefully washed the vegetables. She first cooked the fish, then made half a pot of soup. Half an hour later, we had dinner together. This meal was really delicious, and we all ate a lot."
